_spy":-0.045,"r20_spy":-0.0696}}],"quotes":[{"c":"AIR 2018 Q3","e":"air","d":"2018-03-20","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Ciarmoli","x":"So no immediate push back, I mean, it sounds like they're receptive to some of those price increases?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/03/21/aar-air-q3-2018-earnings-conference-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"AIR 2018 Q3","e":"air","d":"2018-03-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael D. Milligan","x":"SG&A expenses were 11.7% of sales during the quarter, impacted by higher legal expenses and increased personnel-related costs, including higher technology spending as well as early retirement severance charges of $1.1 million, or $0.02 per share.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/03/21/aar-air-q3-2018-earnings-conference-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"AIR 2018 Q3","e":"air","d":"2018-03-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Larry Solow","x":"I know there was a -- a severance there, was there some expenses for INL?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/03/21/aar-air-q3-2018-earnings-conference-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"AIR 2019 Q4","e":"air","d":"2019-07-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Joseph DeNardi","x":"John, is that an area of the business where you're looking at M&A to maybe get yourself some better pricing power?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/10/aar-corp-air-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"AIR 2019 Q4","e":"air","d":"2019-07-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Ciarmoli","x":"The labor pressure and you guys talking about pricing and getting support from your customers, I mean in short, are you guys able to increase your pricing on existing contracts to pass through some of those higher labor rates you might have to be offering out there?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/10/aar-corp-air-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"AIR 2020 Q2","e":"air","d":"2019-12-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Ciarmoli","x":"I mean, is that creating more tightness around 37 parts of availability and giving you more pricing power?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/12/20/aar-corp-air-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"AIR 2020 Q2","e":"air","d":"2019-12-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John M. Holmes","x":"BAE sighted our consistent cost savings and the high-quality delivered by our Amsterdam facility as the basis for this expansion.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/12/20/aar-corp-air-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"AIR 2020 Q2","e":"air","d":"2019-12-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sean Gillen","x":"Excluding investigation and severance costs, which totaled $3.3 million, SG&A would have been 9.6% of sales in the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/12/20/aar-corp-air-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"AIR 2020 Q2","e":"air","d":"2019-12-19","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"John M. Holmes","x":"But overall, we're happy that we're in a position to have raised the guidance overall for the year, and this represents the best view of the opportunities that we see at this time.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/12/20/aar-corp-air-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"AIR 2020 Q3","e":"air","d":"2020-03-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John M. Holmes","x":"These steps include a hiring freeze, reducing or eliminating all non-essential spend, reducing executive compensation, furloughs, and unfortunately, reductions in our workforce.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/03/24/aar-corp-air-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"AIR 2020 Q3","e":"air","d":"2020-03-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John M. Holmes","x":"As described in the release, there are several restructuring actions that we have taken and will take to continue to improve the performance and strength of AAR.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/03/24/aar-corp-air-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"AIR 2020 Q3","e":"air","d":"2020-03-24","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"John M. Holmes","x":"While we are pleased with our Q3 and year-to-date results, which have tracked ahead of our previously raised guidance, due to the effects of COVID-19 on the commercial airline market, we believe it is prudent to withdraw our fiscal year 2020 guidance at this time.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/03/24/aar-corp-air-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"AIR 2020 Q4","e":"air","d":"2020-07-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John M. Holmes","x":"We took numerous cost reduction actions early in the quarter to offset the impact, which we described in our May 21st 8-K including facility closures and consolidations, exiting the unprofitable product lines, and exiting or restructuring underperforming commercial programs contracts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/22/aar-corp-air-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"AIR 2020 Q4","e":"air","d":"2020-07-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sean Gillen","x":"As John mentioned, we took a number of steps in the quarter to reduce our fixed costs and overhead, including closing our Goldsboro and Duluth facilities and exiting or restructuring underperforming contracts and product lines primarily in our commercial programs business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/22/aar-corp-air-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"AIR 2021 Q4","e":"air","d":"2021-07-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John M. Holmes","x":"We did this by consolidating multiple facilities, making permanent reductions to our fixed and variable costs, exiting or restructuring several underperforming commercial programs' contracts and completing the divestiture of our Composites business, which had been unprofitable in recent quarters.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/20/aar-corp-air-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AIR 2021 Q4","e":"air","d":"2021-07-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sean Gillen","x":"And with this termination, our restructuring actions in commercial programs are largely complete.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/20/aar-corp-air-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AIR 2022 Q1","e":"air","d":"2021-09-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Holmes","x":"Like our prior C40 aircraft delivery contract with the U.S. Marine Corps, this contract demonstrates the significant cost savings available to government customers by procuring in the aftermarket.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/09/23/aar-corp-air-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AIR 2022 Q1","e":"air","d":"2021-09-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sean Gillen","x":"SG&A expenses in the quarter were $49.3 million or 10.8% of sales excluding severance of about $1 million, this would have been closer to 10.6% of sales.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/09/23/aar-corp-air-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AIR 2022 Q2","e":"air","d":"2021-12-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sean Gillen","x":"Excluding adjustments of $1.1 million related to severance and investigation and remediation costs, this would have been closer to 10.6% of sales, in line with Q1, despite the decline in sales.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/12/21/aar-corp-air-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AIR 2025 Q4","e":"air","d":"2025-07-17","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"John Holmes","x":"If anything, we actually saw a decline in shipments to certain of our Chinese customers as a result of the tariff behavior there early in the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/17/aar-air-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AIR 2025 Q4","e":"air","d":"2025-07-17","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Scott Mikus","x":"And then, also, did you see any airlines potentially over-ordering parts in the quarter to try and get ahead of tariffs?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/17/aar-air-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AIR 2026 Q2","e":"air","d":"2026-01-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Holmes","x":"This process will take twelve to eighteen months and has three key elements: revenue optimization, cost reduction and process improvements, and footprint rationalization.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/aar-air-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AIR 2026 Q2","e":"air","d":"2026-01-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Holmes","x":"With respect to cost reduction and process improvements, at the HAYCO facilities, our actions to adjust the cost structure to match the new revenue base are already well underway.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/06/aar-air-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AIR 2026 Q3","e":"air","d":"2026-03-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Holmes","x":"…solutions, including tracks and government programs, despite the expected short-term impact on margins from our recently acquired HAECO Americas business, at which we are in the process of rightsizing the revenue base, adjusting the cost structure and deploying our proprietary processes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/25/aar-air-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AIR 2026 Q3","e":"air","d":"2026-03-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Holmes","x":"As I mentioned earlier and consistent with the outlook we described in last quarter's call, margins were negatively impacted in the quarter as we take actions at the recently acquired HAECO Americas operation to rightsize the revenue base, adjust the cost structure and improve processes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/25/aar-air-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AIR 2027 Q1","e":"air","d":"2026-09-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Ciarmoli","x":"I mean, I think Louie called out how much scale and breadth of presence you have, which kind of begs the question, maybe you can get even more pricing and have some pricing power to kind of drive that one-stop shop and convenience for the airlines.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/09/30/aar-air-q1-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AIR 2027 Q1","e":"air","d":"2026-09-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Ciarmoli","x":"Can you offset kind of price increases and maybe that goes to what I was just asking about the pricing power?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/09/30/aar-air-q1-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AIR 2027 Q1","e":"air","d":"2026-09-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Holmes","x":"And just to remind everybody, I mean, that is a meaningful restructuring effort where we bought a business that was significantly underperforming in terms of margin.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/09/30/aar-air-q1-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AIR 2027 Q1","e":"air","d":"2026-09-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Holmes","x":"We're restructuring the business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/09/30/aar-air-q1-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AIR 2027 Q1","e":"air","d":"2026-09-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"John Holmes","x":"And obviously, we've just raised the guide for the full year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/09/30/aar-air-q1-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[32,1,4415,0,0,0,2875,1050],[36,1,5235,0,0,0,3440,1415],[38,1,5721,0,0,0,3963,1195